A49. What go-getters make things do. ~ HUM
A52. Sparrows think they're boulevards. ~ WIRES
A53. In a position to attract interest. ~ DEPOSITED
A56. A humorist whose first name means "fight. ~ LARDNER
A59. The questions of youth—ask Dad, he knows. ~ RIDDLES
A63. This stands many a blow. ~ OBOE
A64. Chamber music at night. ~ SNORE
A66. What makes an Italian mare go. ~ LIRA
A67. A fountain pen's faux pas. ~ BLUR
